    "description": "<p>A once-natural deer twisted by Abraxan ritual bleed, with blackened branching antlers, ember-lit eyes, and a violent compulsion to charge anything that shows fear.</p>\n<section class=\"cybermancy-fast-play\"><h3>FAST PLAY</h3><p><strong><em>Opening:</em></strong> Use Antler Rush from Close against an exposed target so the Deer arrives violently and establishes its charge-and-pursue behavior.</p><p><strong><em>Default:</em></strong> Attack with Antlers in Melee. If distance opens again, look for another useful line for Antler Rush.</p><p><strong><em>On PC Fear:</em></strong> Use Ritual Frenzy when a PC within Close rolls with Fear, especially if it lets the Deer punish a target who thought they were safe.</p><p><strong><em>Pressure:</em></strong> Keep pursuing exposed or fearful prey rather than holding ground like a trained defender.</p><p><strong><em>Goal:</em></strong> Show ritual corruption through relentless animal aggression: charge, scatter the group, and make Fear attract immediate danger.</p></section>",
